{"id":"wb-7-288","name":"李楼遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"李楼遗址","text":"李楼遗址是位于中国河南省汝州市李楼村西的古代聚落遗址，处于北汝河南岸，包含龙山文化及二里头文化时期遗存。其龙山时期遗存属于王湾三期文化在汝河上游地区的分布范围。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E6%A5%BC%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":95031074,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95031074","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":null}